      "message": "In many ways it\u0027d be better to generate build targets for all the versions, to keep the build rule generation static and let the user pick what they want by the target passed to \"m\".\n\nHave you considered that approach? We\u0027d have to add a version list to the sdk modules, but that may be a good thing anyway. I can imagine reasons against it would be ninja rule bloat. Maybe Soong processing time as well, although most of the work ought to be done only once.\n\n+ccross for input on this.",
